===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|telte}}, {{m|enm|tield}}, {{m|enm|teld}}, from {{inh|en|ang|teld|t=tent}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*teld}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*teldą|t=tent}}. Perhaps influenced by {{cog|gml|telt}},<ref>[http://ordnet.dk/ods/opslag?opslag=telt&submit=S%F8g Etymology] in [[:w:da:ODS|ODS]]</ref> or {{cog|da|telt}}.<ref>{{R:Webster 1913|tilt}}</ref> Cognates include {{cog|de|Zelt|t=tent}}, {{cog|non|tjald|t=tent}} (whence also archaic Danish {{m|da|tjæld|t=tent}}). More at {{l|en|teld}}.

